  ('CN-ASBE-BS', 'A05', null, '应收账款', '{"en":"Accounts receivable"}'::jsonb, 40, 1, false, '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], null, '财会〔2019〕6号 附件2, note 3 — the debit balance of 应收账款 less its allowance in 坏账准备; note 16 of the same attachment reads 应付账款 and 预付账款 from the credit and debit balances of their detail accounts, and the same reading is applied here to 应收账款 and 预收账款. 坏账准备 is carried against this line alone: an allowance booked against notes or other receivables belongs on those lines, and a company that books one should split the account.', null),
